21	 * The dark themes invert the tile canvas rather than loading a second style.
22	 * Markers live outside the canvas in their own DOM layer, so the universal pin
23	 * legend keeps its true colours: a red pin has to mean the same thing to the
24	 * rider and to the owner, and inverting it would break that.
